      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......到哪兒去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗷嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那邊的樹枝上......而且還聚起了這麼一大批古靈精怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，這下我要怎麼取來呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一枚黑子。\n萬物皆有所待，這些器倀的脾性，是和這些器物的“意”相通的。\n那麼，擾我清靜的......\n是我那擺弄畫卷潑墨江山的妹妹呢，還是那一字千金口含天憲的妹妹呢？\n又或者......\n只是他一子拍下，砸起的片刻雜音呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚——嗚嗚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好久不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯？您應該是......羅德島的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊。原來是老鯉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不見，怎麼從龍門來尚蜀了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，你說掌櫃的抽刀而走，是不是找誰幹架去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們這些新來的，已經不見掌櫃的用刀啦。想來也是，家大業大的，光靠酒樓就能在尚蜀站穩腳跟了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "掌櫃的到底怎麼用刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "掌櫃的這些年，用刀的次數實在不多。真要說，那就是砍瓜切菜，剁肉殺鱗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起過去打打殺殺的日子，鄭掌櫃已經很久不以“傷人”為目的用刀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有一種江湖高人隱退的感覺？那現在他帶刀出去做啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "切菜吧。切了這麼久的菜了，掌櫃的也就會切切菜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無聊哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然呢，切那麼多年菜，還能變厲害不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好刀法！看來你這幾年不光是在當一個掌櫃的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不，我確實沒有再用過刀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "習慣了持籌握算，柴米油鹽......我也沒想到，這把霜刀如今還能如此順手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "意料之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我還在想，要是遇到的是一個鬱鬱寡歡的鄭清鉞，打贏了又怎樣，輸了又怎樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來是天意如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——什麼天意，不過是你一廂情願想要報仇罷了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夜兒！你別插手！快去追那個龍門人，找到酒盞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉了爹，這件事你可做不了主——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就猜到會這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我從來沒打過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會後悔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......太合叔。你去幫掌櫃的一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "公子您？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去找盞，此事耽擱不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "慢著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，你這大塊頭能不能小心點，再拆下去我們怎麼下山？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "困獸之鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩人！這裡我拖著，你先去幫鯉兄！別讓那小子得手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好！你自己注意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我告訴你可別欺負人啊，就因為你是當官的我才不敢動手的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......官身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我既為報知遇之恩，與左公子同行，還談什麼官身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來！廉家傳人，你我單純以武人身份，互相試試斤兩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那就得罪了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下雨了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_304_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......下起雨來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_304_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明明天氣預報說今天都是晴天來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "客人，下雨了，您要不挪步去裡頭坐坐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "客人是想賞雨景？好興致好興致，那我一會兒給您把傘撐起來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陪您一起的那位船夫呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他上山去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這會上山？天黑了怕是下不來山哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我麻煩他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！是那個龍門人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "器倀圍在他身邊......？等等，他旁邊那個人是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦。好像有新客人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也是來搶這隻酒盞的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呼。比起預想，已經算人少一些的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大炎司歲台秉燭人左樂，奉太傅手諭，密查夕與黑酒盞下落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗷......嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這些小東西，似乎挺怕你倆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怕我嘛，正常，怕這個小子嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你身上帶著什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒是機敏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯哼......是這樣......就和那個糟老頭子說的一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼鯉先生又是怎麼和這件事扯上關係的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "年小姐，這其中恐怕說來話長......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過把羅德島幾位幹員捲入其中，我深感愧疚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無妨。克洛絲和小炎熔要是經歷不起這點風浪，她們也很難見證到最後了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哎呀，年小姐真是沒變呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟這兩天，我們可被折騰慘了。不過那個可怕的老頭兒還是告訴了我們一些事情的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "包括司歲台和禮部之間的小摩擦。這位小哥，你們就這麼急著......想除掉我們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了我擅自把夕帶離她的舒適小窩，一定有別的什麼原因吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說來聽聽？要是說得有理，說不定我能改變心思，幫你們一把哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過既然你主動現身，那更好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她在哪兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你說誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別裝傻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你們爬錯山了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她在山頂，在這片雲海山巒中最高峰的山頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們爬到那座山峰上了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......忘水坪什麼都沒有，與尋常山道無異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！別動那隻杯子——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哦......這不是年嗎？\n好久不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什、什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此時此刻此地，才是尚蜀山巒之中的最高處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一般談論“最高處”的時候，是不用帶上此時此刻的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "良辰美景方為山頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是物理意義上的最高有什麼意義，我在這兒墊一個椅子，不就更高一截了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這個地方......我確實......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在夢裡見過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "年小姐果然知道些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然了。你和這玩意在一起的時間太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然尋常人類發現不了這隻酒盞的秘密，但是司歲台也好你也好都太不注意了點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還是說，這也是你的考量......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。我的事情先不提......那邊那位少年似乎想要積極發言？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......首先，我要求你們為夕的離開做出解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛絲小姐仍舊把你當作羅德島的一員，如此說來，在場三人，全部都與那羅德島有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根據你們的回答和今次事件的結果......我會考慮上書朝廷，嚴肅對待此事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把夕帶走只是我的判斷，羅德島也不過是接受了我的私人委託而已，這樣的答案滿意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不滿意。你們十二人任何一次會晤、通信、交談都是牽扯司歲台神經的大事，你怎會不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，年紀輕輕，口氣倒是挺老成......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "司歲台現在的老大是誰？我認得不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你遊手好閒太久，人間已變了幾個模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夕在哪裡？令又在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們三人相聚尚蜀，又打算做什麼？這隻酒盞......又隱藏了什麼秘密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酒盞明明是你們托人從龍門送來的，怎麼還怪起我們來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道司歲台必須把它握在手裡的意義——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——當然，這其中可是拘押著我那好二哥的部分意識的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你很清楚。那就很難說幾位都是不知者無罪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可沒打算裝什麼不知者......雖然梁洵確實什麼都沒告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，事到如今我說羅德島什麼都不知道會不會有點牽強？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是，畢竟你是受害者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也是剛剛才意識到的。反倒是你們司歲台啊，一群閒著沒事的琢磨了這麼多年，還琢磨不出嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巨獸不僅能將自己分離成擁有獨立人格的代理人，也能將自己的意識存儲在一些媒介中苟且偷生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但是你們代理人原來還能再做一次同樣的事情嗎？就像烏薩斯套娃一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不知道我們能不能啊......說不定是他新琢磨出來的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了湊齊一百八十一顆黑子之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......他不會瘋掉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不是已經瘋掉了嗎。就關押在京城，你們又不是見不到他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與他見面，是莫大的禁忌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "司歲台都做了這麼多事，還在乎這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夕呢？你找夕做什麼？找了夕還來這裡，又為了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我有一個想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根據記載，你總是有很多想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......你倒是挺瞭解我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（看向這邊了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
